{"seq":4,"slug":"information-theory","title":"信息论","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 信息论 简介\n\n信息论是由 Claude Shannon 于 1948 年创立的数学学科，它为信息的度量、传输和压缩提供了严密的理论框架。信息论的核心思想——用概率来量化信息——已经深刻渗透到现代计算机科学的各个领域，从数据压缩算法到机器学习的损失函数设计，信息论的概念无处不在。\n\n本知识库面向具有概率论基础、希望系统理解信息论核心原理及其在编程实践中应用的中级程序员。如果你想理解交叉熵损失函数为什么有效、Huffman 编码为什么最优、或者信息瓶颈理论如何指导深度学习架构设计，本知识库将为你提供从基础到前沿的完整学习路径。\n\n第1章**信息度量基础**建立信息论的核心概念体系，从熵的定义出发，讲解互信息、KL 散度和各种信息不等式，帮助你掌握量化信息和不确定性的基本工具。\n\n第2章**信道与编码**探讨信息可靠传输的理论极限，讲解信道容量、纠错编码和信道模型等核心概念，揭示 Shannon 编码定理背后的深刻含义。\n\n第3章**数据压缩**聚焦于信息的高效表示问题，系统介绍信源编码理论、Huffman 编码、算术编码和无损压缩技术，让你理解数据压缩算法背后的数学原理。\n\n第4章**信息论与机器学习**将信息论的概念与现代机器学习深度融合，讲解交叉熵损失、信息瓶颈理论、率失真理论以及信息论在深度学习中的前沿应用。\n\n建议学习路径为：第一章是所有后续内容的基础，必须首先掌握；第二章和第三章可以根据兴趣选择顺序学习；第四章适合在掌握基础后结合机器学习实践来深入理解。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"information-measures","title":"信息度量基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-measures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"entropy","title":"信息熵","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-measures/entropy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mutual-information","title":"互信息","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-measures/mutual-information"},{"seq":3,"slug":"kl-divergence","title":"KL 散度","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-measures/kl-divergence"},{"seq":4,"slug":"information-inequalities","title":"信息不等式","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-measures/information-inequalities"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"channel-coding","title":"信道与编码","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/channel-coding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"channel-capacity","title":"信道容量","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/channel-coding/channel-capacity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"error-correcting-codes","title":"纠错编码","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/channel-coding/error-correcting-codes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"channel-models","title":"信道模型","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/channel-coding/channel-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-compression","title":"数据压缩","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/data-compression","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"source-coding","title":"信源编码","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/data-compression/source-coding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"huffman-coding","title":"Huffman 编码","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/data-compression/huffman-coding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"arithmetic-coding","title":"算术编码","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/data-compression/arithmetic-coding"},{"seq":4,"slug":"lossless-compression","title":"无损压缩算法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/data-compression/lossless-compression"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"information-theory-ml","title":"信息论与机器学习","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-theory-ml","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-entropy-loss","title":"交叉熵损失","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-theory-ml/cross-entropy-loss"},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-bottleneck","title":"信息瓶颈","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-theory-ml/information-bottleneck"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rate-distortion","title":"率失真理论","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-theory-ml/rate-distortion"},{"seq":4,"slug":"info-theory-deep-learning","title":"信息论与深度学习","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/information-theory/information-theory-ml/info-theory-deep-learning"}]}]}